      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "t": "Waaqayyo hinaafaa dha, gooftaa ijaa baafatuu dhas; Waaqayyo ijaa in baafata, dheekkamsi isaas sodaachisaa dha; Waaqayyo warra isaan morman irratti ijaa in baafata, dheekkamsi isaas baruma baraan diinota isaa irratti in hafa.",
