       "t": "dukkanatti in galcha."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 9,
     "t": "Isaan Waaqayyo irratti maal koratu? Inni raawwatee isaan in balleessa; egaa rakkinni deebi'ee hin argamu.",
     "alt": "፱",
     "lines": [
      {
       "style": "p",
       "t": "Isaan Waaqayyo irratti maal koratu?"
      },
