      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 12,
     "t": "Waaqayyo gooftaan, ?Isaan humna guutuu yoo qabaatan, baay'ee yoo ta'anis, duguugamanii in balleeffamu; yaa Yihudaa, ani kanaan dura si dhiphiseera yoon ta'e iyyuu, si'achi deebi'ee si hin dhiphisu;",
     "alt": "፲፪",
     "lines": [
