     "t": "Yaa Nanawwe, inni rukutee si caccabsu sitti in dhufa, masaraa irra eegduu dhaabi, karaas eegsisi! Mudhii kee jabeeffadhu, humna waraanaa kees cimsii qopheeffadhu!",
